      "problem": "Find the integral of $\\frac{2}{x}+3{x}^{2}$ with respect to $x.$",
      "worked_solution": "Applying the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\frac{2}{x}+3{x}^{2})\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x+3\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+{x}^{3}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
